{"content":"q19. MemoService is served over two protocols: **gRPC-Gateway (REST/JSON-over-HTTP via grpc-gateway)** and **Connect RPC** (used for browser/web clients).\n\n- **gRPC-Gateway** — registration happens via `v1pb.RegisterMemoServiceHandlerServer(ctx, gwMux, s)` in `server/router/api/v1/v1.go:108`, inside `APIV1Service.RegisterGateway` (the generated handler itself lives in `proto/gen/api/v1/memo_service.pb.gw.go:961`).\n- **Connect RPC** — wrapping happens via `apiv1connect.NewMemoServiceHandler(s, opts...)` in `server/router/api/v1/connect_handler.go:40`, inside `ConnectServiceHandler.RegisterConnectHandlers` (called from `server/router/api/v1/v1.go:140-141`; generated handler constructor in `proto/gen/api/v1/apiv1connect/memo_service.connect.go:461`).\n\nBoth mounts are wired together in `APIV1Service.RegisterGateway` (`server/router/api/v1/v1.go:65`), which registers the gateway mux at `/api/v1/*` (line 128) and the Connect mux at `/memos.api.v1.*` (line 144).","iteration":12,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
